  "body": "To download the property documents use the following link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/H4UE\r\n\r\nTucked away in an exclusive pocket of quality homes, just five minutes from Orewa township, this beautifully designed residence offers a wonderful balance of luxury, lifestyle, and versatility. At the last driveway along Hillcrest Road, with no passing traffic beyond, you're surrounded by sweeping native bush views and a wonderful sense of privacy, yet the best of the Hibiscus Coast is right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nBespoke in design and thoughtfully considered for both the here and now and whatever life may bring, this is a home that offers genuine flexibility. With five bedrooms, a separate office, and two lounges, whether you're accommodating extended family, exploring multigenerational living, or simply wanting room to spread out, the possibilities here are exceptional.\r\n\r\nAn exceptionally generous entrance and hallway leads through to the primary suite and second lounge, creating the potential for a separate wing, almost a home within a home. With further bedrooms and a separate laundry downstairs, there's room for independence and connection in equal measure.\r\n\r\nHead upstairs and the home really opens up. A spacious kitchen, dining, and living area is made for entertaining, with a cleverly designed mono-pitch ceiling rising overhead, drawing in natural light and giving the whole space a real wow factor. Large windows frame the native bush, while a generous deck invites you to step outside, take in the views, and enjoy the peace and privacy of this remarkable setting.\r\n\r\nOutside, the landscaping has been beautifully executed, striking that perfect balance between visual appeal and easy-care living. Multiple decks offer places to relax or host friends, while vegetable gardens bring a little garden-to-table living into the mix. Together with the installed solar panels, there's an appealing nod to a more self-sufficient way of life, without giving up modern comforts.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the location. Orewa's cafés, restaurants, shops, and amenities are just minutes away, with Hatfields Beach and the stunning beaches of the Mahurangi Peninsula close by. There's plenty of room for the boat, jet skis, and campervan, making it easy to enjoy everything this coastline has to offer.\r\n\r\nBeautifully considered, wonderfully versatile, and surrounded by nature. A lifestyle that feels a world away, without having to leave it all behind.",
